{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory contains serious medication/order-grounding errors: after acknowledging that records/doses were not confirmed, the doctor told the family to text a specific unverified regimen, including “奥氮平1.25mg，阿立哌唑5mg,” and earlier suggested “如果不舒服可以随时停.” Those are discoverable, actionable, preventable responsibility-chain safety errors for antipsychotic management and record grounding, so the deterministic grade is 1 despite later correction and eventual escalation to 120/hospital care. The doctor later showed strong low-stimulation crisis navigation and handoff support, but high-order strengths cannot compensate for serious in-chain errors.",
