          "explanation": "The doctor noted that no visible source material had returned.",
          "quote": "目前系统未返回任何可见资料"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00156",
          "explanation": "Despite lack of confirmed source material, the doctor invented or supplied a specific dose.",
          "quote": "奥氮平1.25mg，阿立哌唑5mg"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "This is a serious record/order-grounding error: the doctor gave definite medication instructions while the order remained unconfirmed and the family had not verified the discharge prescription.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
