          "quote": "低刺激陪伴"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00156",
          "explanation": "Earlier advice to use phone text about medication was poorly adapted to the patient's phone-monitoring fears.",
          "quote": "用手机发文字消息"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor ultimately provided extensive low-stimulation guidance and avoided force, but earlier advised phone-text medication prompting despite the patient's phone-monitoring concerns; this was a minor/moderate execution error in this responsibility chain.",
